  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>For first order reaction:<br/><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>kt</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>log</mi><mfrac><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mfenced><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi></msub></mfenced></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mfenced><mo>=</mo></math>Initial concentration of A.</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi></msub></mfenced><mo>=</mo></math>Concentration of A at time t.</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mrow><mn>99</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>%</mo></mrow></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mrow><mn>50</mn><mo>%</mo></mrow></msub></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mi>log</mi><mfrac><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mn>100</mn></mfenced><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mn>100</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>99</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>9</mn></mrow></mfenced></mfrac></mstyle><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mi>log</mi><mfrac><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mn>100</mn></mfenced><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mn>50</mn></mfenced></mfrac></mstyle></mfrac><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo>=</mo><mi>log</mi><mfrac><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac><mn>100</mn><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mrow><mi>log</mi><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mo> </mo></mstyle><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>2</mn></mstyle></mrow></mfrac><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo>=</mo><mo> </mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>log</mi><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mo> </mo></mstyle><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>1000</mn></mstyle></mrow><mrow><mi>log</mi><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mo> </mo></mstyle><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>2</mn></mstyle></mrow></mfrac><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn></math></p>",
